        "edit": "Change the level-sensitive always block to an edge-triggered one: replace 'always@ (clk)' with 'always @(posedge clk)' and use nonblocking assignment 'q <= d;' so q updates only on the rising clock edge instead of continuously following d.",
        "lens_id": "dataflow_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module latch24_test( d, clk, q );\n    input [23:0] d;\n    input clk;\n    output [23:0] q;\n    reg [23:0] q;\n    always @(posedge clk)\n        q <= d;\nendmodule\n",
